WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.431 --> 00:00:02.954
Unit six. My Town!

2
00:00:04.115 --> 00:00:10.834
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level two!

3
00:00:10.884 --> 00:00:14.331
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:17.899
Today we learn: My Town. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.823 --> 00:00:23.939
Municipality. Say it with me. Municipality!

6
00:00:27.468 --> 00:00:31.485
Infrastructure. Say it with me. Infrastructure!

7
00:00:34.919 --> 00:00:38.753
Population. Say it with me. Population!

8
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.033
Landmark. Say it with me. Landmark!

9
00:00:49.522 --> 00:00:54.072
Tourist attraction. Say it with me. Tourist attraction!

10
00:00:57.608 --> 00:01:01.625
Local market. Say it with me. Local market!

11
00:01:05.093 --> 00:01:09.060
Urbanization. Say it with me. Urbanization!

12
00:01:12.588 --> 00:01:16.755
Historic site. Say it with me. Historic site!

13
00:01:20.251 --> 00:01:23.918
Development. Say it with me. Development!

14
00:01:27.414 --> 00:01:31.014
Renovation. Say it with me. Renovation!

15
00:01:34.464 --> 00:01:38.064
Facility. Say it with me. Facility!

16
00:01:41.599 --> 00:01:45.099
Growth. Say it with me. Growth!

17
00:01:48.621 --> 00:01:58.804
Grammar time! Present perfect + recently. Listen. The town has grown recently. They have renovated the market.

18
00:01:58.854 --> 00:02:05.180
Your turn. Say it with me. The town has grown recently. They have renovated the market.

19
00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:19.140
Our town's population has grown due to urbanization. A historic site downtown has become a popular tourist attraction after renovation.

20
00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:20.709
I like this story!

21
00:02:21.919 --> 00:02:27.042
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:27.092 --> 00:02:28.242
Population!

23
00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:34.374
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:34.424 --> 00:02:35.650
Urbanization!

25
00:02:36.786 --> 00:02:44.729
Think and answer. What changes have happened in your town recently?

26
00:02:44.779 --> 00:02:45.929
Great answer!

27
00:02:47.051 --> 00:02:51.983
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
